  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Funding from DFID China for Foreign Direct Investment in Africa - ITC Partnership for Investment and Growth in Africa</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">This activity Funding from DFID China for Foreign Direct Investment in Africa - ITC Partnership for Investment and Growth in Africa is a component of Manufacturing Africa - Foreign Direct Investment reported by FCDO with a funding type of 109 - Multilateral organisation and a budget of &#xa3;2,822,634. This project benefits Developing countries, unspecified. It works in the following sector(s): Industrial policy and administrative management, Small and medium-sized enterprises (SME) development, Industrial development, Business policy and administration.</narrative>
  </description>
